Description: simple GTK+ frontend for mpv
 Celluloid (formerly GNOME MPV) is a simple GTK+ frontend for mpv. It
 interacts with mpv via the client API exported by libmpv, giving access to
 mpv's powerful playback capabilities.
 .
 This package is a local rebuild of upstream Celluloid @UPSTREAM_VERSION@
 for the @SUITE@ library set. It is not an official Debian package.
